                              |GKBMEDITATE
|YK0================================================================

|YKB'Meditation is not simply time to be still; seeking inner peace
recharges the mind, and inner peace can knit the body.'|WKO - |RKBMaster
Hu Fong|YK0

Monks excel at keeping their minds and bodies in a balanced
state. When they sit and concentrate, they are able to
recuperate their physical and mental health in a faster than
average fashion. This skill increases significantly with
proper training and eventually a Monk can learn to ignore all
distraction in their environment.

|MKBThis is a Master of the South Wind rank power.

|YKO================================================================

|YK0In addition, Meditate is a skill that relates directly to this
|YK0power.

|YK0++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++|GKB
                        |GKBSKILL OF MEDITATE
|YK0++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++

|YKB'Patience is gained through internal reflection.'|WK0 - |RKBLord Sal
Matis
|YK0
Meditate is a Monk specific stat. It relates primarily to a
Monks ability to focus internally and harness spiritual
energy. The greater the Meditate ability of a Monk, the
greater their ability to utilise this internal reflection.
All Monks gain a rudimentary knowlege of this skill, but it
requires study to take full advantage of it.
